    "reading": "the discrete violation of the identity FALLS under refinement, so the identity is exact in the continuum and what is measured is discretisation error of the sinh-grid operators.  Consequence: (-X Omega_X, 2 nu) is a null direction of the (Omega, nu) Jacobian along EVERY solution, so nu is a gauge coordinate of this profile equation, not an independent continuation parameter.  Corroborating tell in the same table: the `a` leg 125's M7 converges to is itself grid-dependent, which a determinate solution's parameter would not be."
  },
